39028	Enchant Item	Removes the bonuses from one of your items and adds new ones. This item is tradeable.
39029	Reinforce Item	If you're lucky it will add a new bonus onto one of your items (up to a max. of 4 bonuses). This item is tradeable.
39030	Concentrated reading	Multiply by 2.5 the possibility of improving your talent reading the next book (or the soul stone). This object is trade.		
39031	Potion of Haste	This potion reduces the cooldown time of your abilities by 20 percent for 30 minutes. This item is tradeable.
39032	Fruit of life	Increase the classification points in 2000 (load time: 8 hours). This object is trade.		
39033	Correction scroll	This parchment allows you to extract the last stone successfully added from an object. This object is trade.		
39034	Horse sugar	This sugar lump makes it possible to name your horse. In addition, it increases its level of defense by 20. This object is trade.		
39035	Glass of Insight	Allows you to show another player items from your inventory. The glass breaks in the process. This item is tradeable.
39036	Wind shoes	While they are equipped, increase your movement speed by 30 for hours of play. This object is trade.		
