50625	Silver	Bright metal used to make jewelry. It can be added in silver accessories.		
50626	Gold	Golden metal used to make jewellery. It can be worked into gold accessories.
50627	Jade	A valuable mineral that has been used for about 5000 years. It can be added in accessories and jewelry.		
50628	Ebony	The strongest and most light wood of all. It can be added in accessories and jewelry.		
50629	Pearl	Used to make jewelry. It can be added in accessories and jewelry.		
50630	White gold	A hard and white gold alloy that is often used for jewelry.		
50631	Crystal	A hard stone made of crystalline quartz that can be found in different colours. Often used for jewellery.
